## Domains

### `types.email_address`

Canonical application email address

**Base type:** `text`

**Nullable:** no

**Owner:** `domain_owner`

**Collation:** `pg_catalog."C"`

**Default:** `''::text`

**Constraint:** `email_not_blocked`: `CHECK (VALUE <> 'blocked@example.com'::text) NOT VALID`; not validated

**Constraint:** `email_shape`: `CHECK (VALUE ~ '^[^@]+@[^@]+$'::text)`; Requires one at-sign

```sql
CREATE DOMAIN "types"."email_address"
    AS text
    COLLATE pg_catalog."C"
    DEFAULT ''::text
    NOT NULL
    CONSTRAINT "email_not_blocked" CHECK (VALUE <> 'blocked@example.com'::text) NOT VALID NOT VALID
    CONSTRAINT "email_shape" CHECK (VALUE ~ '^[^@]+@[^@]+$'::text);
```


